{"id":"e7154db810649ee7","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-preference.md","title":"Preference Relation","display":"df-preference — Preference Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-preference","aliases":["58-df-preference","Preference Relation"],"display":"df-preference — Preference Relation","depends_on":["[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-preference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-preference</span><span>Preference Relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-preference — Preference Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land X\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land X\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span> (nonempty choice set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succsim \\subseteq X \\times X\">\\(\\succsim \\subseteq X \\times X\\)</span> (preference relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x, y, z \\in X\">\\(x, y, z \\in X\\)</span> (alternatives)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Preference}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Preference}_S\\)</span> (weak preference predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}preference} \\vdash \\mathrm{Preference}_S(X,\\succsim)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land X\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\succsim\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\succsim y\\lor y\\succsim x)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(x\\succsim y\\land y\\succsim z\\to x\\succsim z)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}preference} \\vdash \\mathrm{Preference}_S(X,\\succsim)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land X\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\succsim\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\succsim y\\lor y\\succsim x)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(x\\succsim y\\land y\\succsim z\\to x\\succsim z)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Weak preference: reflexive, complete relation; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x, y : x \\succsim y \\lor y \\succsim x\">\\(\\forall x, y : x \\succsim y \\lor y \\succsim x\\)</span></li>\n<li>Strict preference: asymmetric part; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\succ y \\iff x \\succsim y \\land \\neg(y \\succsim x)\">\\(x \\succ y \\iff x \\succsim y \\land \\neg(y \\succsim x)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Acyclicity: no cycles <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1 \\succ x_2 \\succ \\cdots \\succ x_n \\succ x_1\">\\(x_1 \\succ x_2 \\succ \\cdots \\succ x_n \\succ x_1\\)</span>; necessary for existence of utility</li>\n<li>Transitive: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\succsim y \\land y \\succsim z \\implies x \\succsim z\">\\(x \\succsim y \\land y \\succsim z \\implies x \\succsim z\\)</span>; ensures no paradoxes</li>\n<li>Debreu scrap: continuous complete preference on connected space has continuous utility representation</li>\n<li>Strict preference and indifference are derived relations.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mas-Colell, Whinston and Green, Microeconomic Theory</li>\n<li>Kreps, Notes on the Theory of Choice</li>\n<li>Arrow, Social Choice and Individual Values</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land X\\neq\\emptyset$ (nonempty choice set, see [[58-df-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land X\\neq\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\succsim \\subseteq X \\times X","display":false},{"tex":"x, y, z \\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Preference}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}preference} \\vdash \\mathrm{Preference}_S(X,\\succsim)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land X\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\succsim\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\succsim y\\lor y\\succsim x)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(x\\succsim y\\land y\\succsim z\\to x\\succsim z)","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x, y : x \\succsim y \\lor y \\succsim x","display":false},{"tex":"x \\succ y \\iff x \\succsim y \\land \\neg(y \\succsim x)","display":false},{"tex":"x_1 \\succ x_2 \\succ \\cdots \\succ x_n \\succ x_1","display":false},{"tex":"x \\succsim y \\land y \\succsim z \\implies x \\succsim z","display":false}],"bytes":1572,"backlinks":[{"id":"0597127ba0cc6437","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Preference}_S$ (complete-transitive preference predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-preference.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-977","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-preference.md|58-df-preference]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad"]}